    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/46bf32f14bffa4d9f8963410c936f274.avif?t=1753344034\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Treasure of Creation </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the universe's exploration, several supreme treasures of creation were born together, each possessing the function of defying the heavens. The ultimate treasure of creation is the creation of heaven and earth, the secret of invading the sun and moon, possessing one's own spiritual intelligence and immortality. As long as a cultivator with the treasure of creation can grow up, they will dominate a certain realm and become the supreme strength. When the owner of the treasure of creation falls, it will escape and cannot be captured, drifting in the vast universe, and then searching for someone who is destined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/bc2ef54760f5b6f08abc40d3d48fcd19.poster.avif?t=1753344034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/bc2ef54760f5b6f08abc40d3d48fcd19.webm?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/bc2ef54760f5b6f08abc40d3d48fcd19.mp4?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Stories </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Hongmengzhu, Lucky Golden Axe, Lucky Lotus, Lucky Wood Leaf... Each Lucky Treasure corresponds to a character's story. They are either beggars from the slums or wealthy ladies living in luxury. In the dark, they were chosen as the treasure of creation and wandered through this treacherous world of cultivation. They either killed each other out of love, family, or friendship, opening a magnificent story of cultivation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/5119e0aacd1e460eb95d8d231a528979.avif?t=1753344034\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/60c694d7979c2ad2cd321c3d2c485f09.avif?t=1753344034\" /></span>\u201cFate of Creation\u201d is an open cultivation of immortal world fill with events and story, which allow you to explore freely and write their own legendary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/e4a9adee8cc06b80589c4e1ea887290c.poster.avif?t=1753344034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/e4a9adee8cc06b80589c4e1ea887290c.webm?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/e4a9adee8cc06b80589c4e1ea887290c.mp4?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/16b8dffce6d0a93c93f31d06e64d9d83.avif?t=1753344034\" /></span>Game story will be changed by your decision, and each decision will lead player to a different destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/bf2e71382ba141636c3d5369260a7162.poster.avif?t=1753344034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/bf2e71382ba141636c3d5369260a7162.webm?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/bf2e71382ba141636c3d5369260a7162.mp4?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple endings in this game, so please twice think before you leap. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/253a7388dde8e275c44ce7efb683e7fe.avif?t=1753344034\" /></span>By beating powerful enemy or having extraordinary encouters are able to help you gain a variety of skills and spells. Use your powerful skills and ingenious strategy to frighten your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/c6dcfdbc250a9ccf89d422d11563106a.poster.avif?t=1753344034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/c6dcfdbc250a9ccf89d422d11563106a.webm?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/c6dcfdbc250a9ccf89d422d11563106a.mp4?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get into the world of &quot;Fate of Creation&quot;, explore the beautiful mountains and lakes, meet all kinds of cultivators, and build your own legandary in the &quot;Fate of Creation&quot;.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/46bf32f14bffa4d9f8963410c936f274.avif?t=1753344034\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Treasure of Creation </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the universe's exploration, several supreme treasures of creation were born together, each possessing the function of defying the heavens. The ultimate treasure of creation is the creation of heaven and earth, the secret of invading the sun and moon, possessing one's own spiritual intelligence and immortality. As long as a cultivator with the treasure of creation can grow up, they will dominate a certain realm and become the supreme strength. When the owner of the treasure of creation falls, it will escape and cannot be captured, drifting in the vast universe, and then searching for someone who is destined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/bc2ef54760f5b6f08abc40d3d48fcd19.poster.avif?t=1753344034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/bc2ef54760f5b6f08abc40d3d48fcd19.webm?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/bc2ef54760f5b6f08abc40d3d48fcd19.mp4?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich Stories </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Hongmengzhu, Lucky Golden Axe, Lucky Lotus, Lucky Wood Leaf... Each Lucky Treasure corresponds to a character's story. They are either beggars from the slums or wealthy ladies living in luxury. In the dark, they were chosen as the treasure of creation and wandered through this treacherous world of cultivation. They either killed each other out of love, family, or friendship, opening a magnificent story of cultivation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/5119e0aacd1e460eb95d8d231a528979.avif?t=1753344034\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/60c694d7979c2ad2cd321c3d2c485f09.avif?t=1753344034\" /></span>\u201cFate of Creation\u201d is an open cultivation of immortal world fill with events and story, which allow you to explore freely and write their own legendary. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/e4a9adee8cc06b80589c4e1ea887290c.poster.avif?t=1753344034\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/e4a9adee8cc06b80589c4e1ea887290c.webm?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/e4a9adee8cc06b80589c4e1ea887290c.mp4?t=1753344034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/16b8dffce6d0a93c93f31d06e64d9d83.avif?t=1753344034\" /></span>Game story will be changed by your decision, and each decision will lead player to a different destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2377930/extras/bf2e71382ba141636c3d5369260a7162.poster.avif?t=1753344034\" ><source src=\"https://sha